<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Can't Believe She Got Away</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">THE DRIVER ERA, Ross Lynch, Rocky</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">I'd Rather Die</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">62dTS8FYyzvn2Kqn9KkIdW</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.403" end="00:04.300">Go care if you want to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.300" end="00:08.307">I'll be on the other side</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.307" end="00:12.331">So say what you need to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.331" end="00:15.913">'Cause the truth is better than a lie (A lie)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.913" end="00:17.413" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.215" end="00:20.150">What are we doing anyway? (Anyway, anyway)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.150" end="00:24.178">Why should I care about yesterday? (Yesterday, yesterday)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.178" end="00:28.093">I keep on smoking anyway (Anyway)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.093" end="00:32.264">I can't believe she got away (She got away, she got away)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.264" end="00:33.764" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.469" end="00:38.144">Ay, ay, ay, ay, eh-ay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.144" end="00:40.700">I can't believe she got away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.700" end="00:46.190">Ay, ay, ay, ay, eh-ay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.190" end="00:48.929">I can't believe she got away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.929" end="00:56.929" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.054" end="01:08.360">She said, "Gonna haunt you in your dreams"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.360" end="01:11.281">She had me all the way down on my knees</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.281" end="01:14.469">She said, "Shoulda showed up"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.469" end="01:16.346">Wish I knew how</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.346" end="01:19.373">How to love you like you want me to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.373" end="01:23.130">Whatchu like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.130" end="01:27.169">Stop wasting time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.169" end="01:31.163">Don't wanna fight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.163" end="01:33.890">Do what you like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.890" end="01:35.390" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.143" end="01:38.097">What are we doing anyway?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.097" end="01:42.133">See I don't care about yesterday?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.133" end="01:46.101">I keep on smoking anyway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.101" end="01:50.088">I can't believe she got away (She got away, she got away)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.088" end="01:52.415">I can't believe she got away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.415" end="01:53.915" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.694" end="01:58.142">Ay, ay, ay, ay, eh-ay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.142" end="02:00.574">I can't believe she got away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.574" end="02:06.142">Ay, ay, ay, ay, eh-ay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.142" end="02:10.124">I can't believe she got away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.124" end="02:14.133">I can't believe she got away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.133" end="02:18.202">I can't believe she got away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.202" end="02:23.877">I can't believe she got away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.877" end="02:27.877" /></div></body></tt>